<title>UK: Abbey National unit sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National unit sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following TEC-10 linked bond was announced by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON    *5.40	MATURITY    20.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.76    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.11    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYS 5.4 PCT PLUS THE MAX OF ZERO OR THE TEC-10</p>
<p>		YIELD MINUS 8.0 PCT. PAYABLE QUARLERLY BOND BASIS.</p>
<p> LISLING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
